- Assert that Doctor does not report full mutation-capable health when run with an interpreter that
  can read the database but cannot execute its accounting-trigger writes.
- Assert that an inventory with a resolvable `Parent:` map link produces an immutable-ID relation
  and that `document_store related/context` returns it after conversion.
- Preserve normal-fallback distinctions: the observed App Server `needs_more_context` GUI fallback
