- The protected updater history contained an initial `TSU-801 / unknown` failure at
  `workspace-preflight` with no actionable cause or continuation guidance; a retry about thirty
  seconds later installed `0.52.1` successfully. This is direct evidence that bounded failure
  reporting needs more diagnostic resolution.
